      "proof_review": {
        "reviewed": true,
        "context_checked": true,
        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "The full Theorem6.1 proof and all essential residue supports7.1–7.6 are supplied. The lattice is saturated and lies in the sum-zero hyperplane, gamma and alpha are real as in Section2, total nonresonance is Definition2.4, and a full Mellin–Barnes basis is assumed. The conclusion is invariance under M_MB defined in5.1, not invariance under the full monodromy group whose equality with M_MB is explicitly unknown in general. Exact transition matrices5.1 and diagonal formula6.1 are retained. The prior GKZ rank/irreducibility and Beukers basis/convergence results are established background. Full new wall-crossing residue equality and chamber connection are author-proved; no later signature consequence is independently counted."
      },
